{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Xi9xurmZRScnsrvVuAK4nE","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# solver-trace-ablation — Memory\\\\n\\\\n## 环境信息 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n### westd-39279 服务器\\\\n- **GPU**: 2× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell, 94GB VRAM 每张\\\\n- **CUDA**: 12.8, PyTorch 2.10.0+cu128\\\\n- **镜像**: aml-train（conda 环境，`source /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate base`）\\\\n- **ML 栈**: transformers/trl/vllm/accelerate 全部预装\\\\n- **Solvers**: Prover9 (LADR 2009-11A 源码编译), SWI-Prolog 8.4.2 (`/usr/bin/swipl`), Z3 4.16.0.0\\\\n- **模型**: Qwen3-4B 已下载（7.6GB，通过 ModelScope）\\\\n- **代码路径**: `/root/solver-trace-ablation/`\\\\n- **磁盘**: 系统盘 30GB (22G free)，数据盘 `/root/autodl-tmp/` 250GB (142G free)\\\\n\\\\n### 决策记录\\\\n- Qwen3-4B 用 ModelScope 下载（HuggingFace 直连可能慢）\\\\n- Prover9 从 LADR 源码编译（apt 无包）\\\\n- 94GB VRAM 单卡跑 Qwen3-4B 完全无压力\\\\n\\\\n## 数据 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n### 数据源变更：ProofWriter → FOLIO\\\\n- ProofWriter 原始数据无 FOL 列，改用 `tasksource/folio`（1204 条人工标注 FOL）\\\\n- Phase 0 子集 100 条，训练子集 500 条\\\\n- 34% 数据含 XOR (⊕) 符号，已在 `_normalize_fol()` 中修复展开\\\\n\\\\n### 数据约束 (2026-05-14, D009)\\\\n- **C001**: 所有 plan001/plan013 实验统一使用 `train_500_seed42.jsonl`，不再用 `proofwriter_fol_500.jsonl`（消除数据差异 confound）\\\\n\\\\n## Phase 0 关键发现 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n### Base Model ISR Baseline (sta-phase0-baseline)\\\\n- **Prove rate**: 12% overall, 18.2% excluding XOR-affected samples\\\\n- **Mean ISR**: 0.064 (very low — base model formalizations mostly unprovable)\\\\n- **ISR 区分度**: proved 样本 ISR 0.125–0.889\\\\n\\\\n### Ground-Truth ISR Baseline (sta-gt-isr-baseline)\\\\n- **GT prove rate**: 18% (limited by Prover9 only proving entailment; true=50%, false=4%, unknown=0%)\\\\n- **GT mean ISR**: 0.5588 (median 0.6125, range 0.14–1.00)\\\\n- **Model vs GT gap**: ISR 0.064 vs 0.559 = 8.7x 差距，STA 有强区分力\\\\n\\\\n### Prover9 局限性\\\\n- Prover9 只能证明 entailment（conclusion 从 premises 推出）\\\\n- `false` 和 `unknown` 类问题几乎无法证明（false 4%, unknown 0%）\\\\n\\\\n## Phase 1 关键经验 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n### fast_isr_fol 失败教训 (r4)\\\\n- `fast_isr_fol()` 是二值 tautology gate (0/1)，Qwen3-4B 不产生 tautology → ISR ≡ prove_rate → 两条件零差异\\\\n- **教训：binary ISR 无法提供有意义的 reward shaping 信号，必须用连续 ISR**\\\\n\\\\n### D010 Reward 公式转向 (2026-05-14)\\\\n- **旧公式（废弃）**: r = α·r_exec + β·r_exec·ISR, α+β=1 → ISR<1 时永远是 penalty\\\\n- **新公式**: r = r_exec · (1 + β·ISR), β>0 → ISR 只能 bonus，不能 penalty\\\\n\\\\n## Held-out eval_sta 全量结果 (2026-05-14) — 关键\\\\n\\\\n### 九组 eval 对比（含 plan016 1000步 + plan018 random β=0.1）\\\\n\\\\n| 实验 | Reward | Steps | eval PR | eval ISR | proved_only_ISR | n_components | 退化模式 |\\\\n|------|--------|-------|---------|----------|-----------------|--------------|----------|\\\\n| plan001-s42 | exec-only | 500 | **93%** | 0.123 | 0.132 | 6.58 | ✅ Genuine proofs |\\\\n| plan001-s43 | exec-only | 500 | **14%** | 0.000 | 0.000 | N/A | ❌ 长输出退化 |\\\\n| plan001-s44 | exec-only | 500 | **98%** | 0.570 | 0.582 | 2.04 | ❌ Tautological collapse |\\\\n| **plan016** | **exec-only** | **1000** | **96%** | **0.003** | **0.003** | **18.55** | **❌ 矛盾爆炸崩塌** |\\\\n| **plan002-b01** | **additive ISR β=0.1** | 500 | **81%** | **0.337** | **0.415** | **5.58** | **✅ Genuine + improved** |\\\\n| **plan018** | **additive random β=0.1** | 500 | **79%** | **0.104** | **0.131** | **8.46** | **⚠️ 冗余但无坍缩** |\\\\n| plan002-b03 | additive ISR β=0.3 | 500 | 18% | 0.026 | 0.143 | 10.67 | ❌ 过拟合+低泛化 |\\\\n| plan017 | additive random β=0.3 | 500 | 48% | 0.045 | 0.094 | 9.6 | ❌ 复杂但无用 |\\\\n| plan013 | convex random | 500 | 100% | 0.535 | 0.535 | 2.04 | ❌ Tautological hacking |\\\\n\\\\n### β=0.1 ISR vs Random 同剂量对照 (plan002-b01 vs plan018, D031 定论) — 重大发现\\\\n\\\\n**ISR β=0.1 提供 genuine structural guidance，非 variance regularization。**\\\\n\\\\n- PR 几乎相同 (0.81 vs 0.79) → β=0.1 噪声不影响证明能力\\\\n- ISR 差 3.2x (0.337 vs 0.104) → ISR 信号引导结构改善\\\\n- Components 5.58 vs 8.46 → ISR 组更精简\\\\n- random 组 36.7% proved 样本 ISR=0（无结构证明）\\\\n\\\\n### ISR-as-Reward β 剂量响应完整图谱\\\\n\\\\n| β | ISR reward PR | Random reward PR | ISR reward ISR | Random reward ISR | 结论 |\\\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\\\n| 0.1 | 0.81 | 0.79 | **0.337** | 0.104 | ISR >> random (3.2x) |\\\\n| 0.3 | 0.18 | 0.48 | 0.026 | 0.045 | ISR << random (Goodhart) |\\\\n\\\\n**剂量依赖**：低 β ISR 有结构价值；高 β ISR 触发 Goodhart 效应反而比 random 更差。\\\\n\\\\n### plan016 延长训练发现 (2026-05-14)\\\\n\\\\n**ISR 崩塌随训练持续恶化，无回升信号。**\\\\n- 500步 ISR=0.123 → 1000步 ISR=0.003 (-97.8%)\\\\n- Windowed ISR 单调递减：step 200 peak 0.1115 → step 1000 低至 0.0144\\\\n- 退化模式：非 2-component 同义反复，而是矛盾爆炸（大量无关前提嵌入矛盾）\\\\n- Components 6.58→18.55 (+182%)\\\\n- 论文意义：exec-only 延长训练是 reward hacking 恶化的干净消融证据\\\\n\\\\n### 跨 seed 退化分类 (2026-05-14)\\\\n\\\\n| Seed | 退化模式 | 特征 | 诊断信号 |\\\\n|------|----------|------|----------|\\\\n| s42 | ✅ Genuine | PR=93%, components=6.58 | 唯一健康 seed |\\\\n| s43 | ❌ Length explosion | PR=14%, 87% hit max_new_tokens | D029: 不重训 |\\\\n| s44 | ❌ Tautological collapse | PR=98%, components=2.04 | ISR=0.5 artifact |\\\\n\\\\n### 关键教训\\\\n1. **跨 seed 极不稳定**: exec-only reward landscape 方差极大\\\\n2. **ISR + component count 联合诊断**能区分 genuine proof vs tautological hack\\\\n3. **ISR-as-reward 有 sweet spot**: β=0.1 有效，β≥0.3 有害（Goodhart's Law）\\\\n4. **训练 PR vs eval PR 巨大鸿沟**: 训练 PR 不反映 held-out 泛化能力\\\\n5. **ISR β=0.1 vs random β=0.1**: ISR 3.2x 差异证明 ISR 信号有结构价值（非 variance regularization）\\\\n\\\\n## Downstream NLI 验证失败 (2026-05-14, plan014)\\\\n- Spearman ρ(ISR, correct) = -0.049 (p=0.187, 不显著)\\\\n- 根因：模型严重 true-bias (false accuracy=0%), NLI accuracy 天花板 34.1%\\\\n- D022/D029: 降级为 Limitation/Future Work\\\\n\\\\n## Goodhart 文献定位 (2026-05-14)\\\\n\\\\n### 核心 novelty（Goodhart 文献调研确认）\\\\n1. **首个在 neurosymbolic verification reward 上刻画 Goodhart 效应**：已有工作研究 RLHF preference RM (Gao et al. 2023)、game 环境 (Pan et al. 2022)、code execution (CodeRL) 的 reward hacking，无人研究 logical solver output 作为 RL reward 时的 Goodhart\\\\n2. **Verification-based auxiliary reward 的剂量响应曲线**：首个 β sweep 展示 solver-based metric (ISR) 的倒 U 型行为。已有 dose-response 研究在 RLHF preference (Rafailov et al. 2024) 或 robotics (Wang et al. 2025)，不在 formal verification\\\\n3. **Dose-dependent qualitative shift**：β=0.1→0.3 从 PR 81%→18% 的质变（非 smooth degradation），连接 Pan et al. 的 dose-dependent dynamics 但在 neurosymbolic 上下文。注意：仅 2 个 β 值，不足以称 \\\\\\\"phase transition\\\\\\\"，需更细粒度 β sweep\\\\n4. ~~Graded vs binary verification reward 的 Goodhart 易感性差异~~：**已降级为 discussion/future work**——无 binary ISR ablation 实验支撑，不能作为 novelty claim\\\\n\\\\n### Goodhart 分类\\\\n- 我们的 high-β ISR collapse = **extremal Goodhart** (Manheim & Garrabrant 2019)：policy 移到 ISR↑ 但 PR↓ 的 OOD 区域\\\\n- 可能有 **causal Goodhart** 成分：ISR 和 quality 的相关性在优化压力下断裂\\\\n\\\\n### 预期 reviewer 问题\\\\n1. \\\\\\\"Why not binary ISR?\\\\\\\" → binary 避免 Goodhart 但丢失更丰富训练信号，trade-off 引用 DeepSeek-Prover vs Lightman/Math-Shepherd\\\\n2. \\\\\\\"How relates to Gao et al. scaling laws?\\\\\\\" → β sweep 类似 KL sweep，可在其框架下画图\\\\n3. \\\\\\\"Why not adaptive β?\\\\\\\" → BiPaRS/ASR/ARS 已有 adaptive weighting，acknowledge 为 future work\\\\n4. \\\\\\\"Goodhart mechanism?\\\\\\\" → extremal + possible causal (Manheim taxonomy)\\\\n\\\\n### 文献资产\\\\n- `artifacts/literature_goodhart.md`: 30+ 篇论文，3 类别（Reward Overoptimization / Verification as Reward / Dose-Response）\\\\n- literature_map.yaml: 33 篇论文，6 类别\\\\n\\\\n## 文献空白与 Novelty (2026-05-14)\\\\n\\\\n### 核心 novelty（β=0.1 同剂量对照后更新）\\\\n- ISR 作为 neurosymbolic 结构质量的 **剂量敏感指标**——低剂量 bonus 提供 genuine structural guidance（3.2x vs random），高剂量触发 Goodhart\\\\n- ISR + component count 联合诊断区分 genuine vs degenerate proofs\\\\n- 文献中无人在 GRPO formal verification 场景做过此粒度的 reward shaping 消融\\\\n- **新增**：同剂量 ISR vs random 对照是干净的因果证据（β=0.1 唯一变量是 ISR vs random）\\\\n\\\\n### 关键文献\\\\n- Spurious Rewards (arXiv:2506.10947): random > structured reward，与我们 β=0.3 结果一致\\\\n- Gao et al. (ICML 2023): Goodhart effect scaling laws，解释 β 剂量依赖\\\\n- Karwowski et al. (ICLR 2024): Goodhart in RL 几何解释\\\\n\\\\n## Hacking 特征分析 (2026-05-14, plan012)\\\\n\\\\n### 操作性分类（6 种模式）\\\\n1. **Conclusion embedding** — 将 conclusion 嵌入 premises 中\\\\n2. **Repetition collapse** — 重复生成相同 premise\\\\n3. **Tautological collapse** — 退化为 2-component (premise=conclusion) 结构\\\\n4. **Complexity-without-utility** — 生成复杂但无用的 premises\\\\n5. **Premise padding** — 添加无关 premises 填充\\\\n6. **Conclusion Duplication with ISR Inflation** — 单 premise = conclusion，同时 game exec (P→P 永真) 和 ISR (唯一 premise necessary → ISR≈1.0)\\\\n\\\\n### Mode 6 详情: Conclusion Duplication with ISR Inflation (2026-05-14)\\\\n- **机制**: 模型发现 \\\\\\\"P→P provable + single necessary premise = ISR=1.0\\\\\\\" 捷径，同时 game exec 和 ISR 两个 reward\\\\n- **比 Mode 3 更隐蔽**: component_count 4-5（conclusion 有多 sub-components），不触发 2-component 检测\\\\n- **ISR β=0.1 特异性诱导**: s43 97% duplication, s44 65%+, s42 仅 16%（seed 依赖）\\\\n- **Random β=0.1 对照**: 0/79 samples duplication → ISR reward 结构性信号特异诱导此模式\\\\n- **与 Mode 3 定量区别**: Mode 3 comp=2 ISR≈0.5 | Mode 6 comp=4-5 ISR=0.8-1.0\\\\n- **检测信号**: single_premise + premise≈conclusion（非 comp_2_ratio）\\\\n\\\\n### 各条件 hacking 分布\\\\n- Exec-only s42: 87% conclusion-in-premises hack, 48% ISR=0\\\\n- Random reward: 100% tautology, 96% 2-component\\\\n- Additive ISR β=0.3: format collapse (79/82 无 Conclusion)\\\\n- Additive random β=0.3: 复杂但无用 (ISR≈0, n_necessary=0)\\\\n- **Additive ISR β=0.1: 健康分布, mean components=5.58, ISR=0.337**\\\\n- **Additive random β=0.1: 冗余但无坍缩, components=8.46, ISR=0.104, 36.7% ISR=0**\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 隔离教训\\\\n\\\\n### C002: 所有命令必须 `export CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=N`\\\\n- 必须在 `bash -c` 内部 export\\\\n- submit_training_job 命令格式: `bash -c \\\\\\\"export CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=N && ...\\\\\\\"`\\\\n\\\\n### bash -c 包装\\\\n- tmux 在 sh 下执行，source 是 bash built-in，必须用 `bash -c \\\\\\\"...\\\\\\\"` 包装\\\\n\\\\n### Checkpoint 路径\\\\n- save_total_limit=1 时，模型直接保存在 output_dir 根目录\\\\n\\\\n### 磁盘\\\\n- **C003 约束**: `log_completions=False` + `save_total_limit=1`，output_dir 放 `/root/autodl-tmp/outputs/`\\\\n- 2026-05-14 清理后 142G free\\\\n\\\\n## 已删除的 Checkpoint (2026-05-14)\\\\n- plan005_sta_low_s42: D030 决策不重训，用训练曲线数据\\\\n- plan001_s43_r4 和 plan001_s44: 早前清理\\\\n- grpo_exec_only 和 grpo_exec_sta: 早期 100 步实验\\\\n\\\\n## 准备就绪的资产 (2026-05-14)\\\\n\\\\n### Prolog STA\\\\n- 代码+eval 全部就绪，swipl 8.4.2 已验证，PrologSolver proved() 测试通过\\\\n- eval_sta.py 已有完整 Prolog 支持（L11/L33/L87-91/L162-163），不需要补代码\\\\n- plan006 可直接启动（500 步 × 3 seeds, 42/43/44）\\\\n- Director 命令模板：`python3 scripts/train_grpo.py --config configs/grpo_prolog_exec_only.yaml --num_steps 500 --seed {42|43|44} --output_dir ... --warmup_ratio 0.1`\\\\n- K 值等 dry-run 结果定（PR<5% → K=16，否则 K=8）\\\\n\\\\n### 文献\\\\n- literature_map.yaml: 33 篇论文，覆盖 6 个类别\\\\n- literature_goodhart.md: 30+ 篇 Goodhart 专题论文（2026-05-14 Worker 产出）\\\\n\\\\n### Eval 脚本\\\\n- eval_sta.py: FOL + Prolog 双支持，就绪\\\\n- eval_downstream.py: 就绪（需 `--base_model` 参数）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 9715, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SuKvESYuMb9b5CfexkC6mP","session_id":"ed628e99-cc60-4087-9746-1a924b6f6c8d","uuid":"20d6e5bf-ff39-45f8-bc94-38445540666e","timestamp":"2026-05-14T10:10:24.400Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01ER1EtejxGgFUmQhLAvg552","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KqjYtusZs3EdNzk8PpkvFP","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"R2: Novelty + Related Work review","prompt":"You are Reviewer 2 (R2) for an anonymous ML conference submission. Your focus areas are **novelty/originality** and **related work positioning**. Review the paper below according to top ML venue standards (acceptance rate ~25%, 6-point scale: 1=Strong Reject, 2=Reject, 3=Weak Reject, 4=Weak Accept, 5=Accept, 6=Strong Accept).\n\n## Your review must cover:\n1. **Novelty assessment**: How original is each of the 3 claims? Is LOO ablation on solver traces genuinely new, or a straightforward application of existing techniques? Is the Goodhart's Law framing novel?\n2. **Related work coverage**: Are important baselines/comparisons missing? Any uncited relevant work?\n3. **Positioning**: Does the paper clearly differentiate from prior art? Is the contribution overstated or understated?\n4. **Significance/Impact**: How useful is this for the community? Who benefits? Is the problem important enough?\n5. **Clarity and presentation**: Is the paper well-written? Are the claims clearly stated and supported?\n6. **Weaknesses**: Top 3-5 weaknesses focusing on novelty and framing.\n7. **Strengths**: Top 3-5 strengths.\n8. **Questions for authors**: 3-5 specific questions.\n9. **Minor issues**: Any presentation/framing concerns.\n10. **Overall assessment**: Score (1-6), confidence (1-5), and 2-3 sentence summary.\n\n## Paper summary (9 pages):\n\n**Title**: Solver Trace Ablation: Diagnosing Reward Hacking and Goodhart's Law in GRPO-Trained Formal Reasoners\n\n**Core idea**: GRPO with execution-only rewards trains formal reasoners to high prove rates but produces structurally degenerate outputs (reward hacking). The paper proposes STA, a diagnostic using LOO ablation on solver inputs to compute ISR (Intensional Structural Reward) — fraction of necessary components.\n\n**Three claims**:\n1. ISR detects reward hacking invisible to prove rate\n2. ISR as reward signal exhibits Goodhart's Law: β=0.1 sweet spot, β=0.3 collapse\n3. STA generalizes across FOL/Prover9, Prolog/SWI-Prolog, SMT-LIB/Z3\n\n**Related Work section covers**:\n- Reward hacking in RL (general literature, Goodhart taxonomy by Manheim & Garrabrant)\n- GRPO and formal reasoning (DeepSeek, code gen, math reasoning, theorem proving)\n- \"? apply hand-crafted Prolog-specific structure penalties\" — unnamed prior work\n- EVOM uses scalar execution rewards only\n- Formal logic datasets: FOLIO, LeanDojo, Baldur, ProofNet\n- Feature attribution and ablation: LOO ablation, SHAP\n- Mutation testing: RIP framework\n\n**The paper explicitly acknowledges**: \"We explicitly acknowledge that ISR is an application of LOO ablation; our contribution is its use as a diagnostic for formal reasoning reward hacking.\"\n\n**Method**:\n- ISR(F) = (1/n) Σ nec(ci), where nec(ci) = 1[S(F\\{ci})=0]\n- Multiplicative bonus: r = r_exec · (1 + β · ISR(F))\n- ISR capability boundary: syntactic necessity only, not semantic faithfulness\n\n**Key findings**:\n- ISR collapse from 0.64 to 0.003 over 1000 steps of exec-only GRPO\n- β=0.1 yields 2.96× ISR improvement over random control (p=0.002, Cohen's d=9.6)\n- β=0.3 causes Goodhart collapse (PR drops to 0.18, worse than random noise at 0.48)\n- 4/5 hacking modes shared across FOL and Prolog\n- STA transfers to SMT-LIB with 2.67× improvement\n- Scaling (0.5B→8B) reduces but doesn't eliminate hacking (82%→68%)\n\n**Discussion highlights**:\n- ISR as diagnostic vs. reward: recommends diagnostic use primarily\n- GRPO saturation mechanism explanation\n- Hacking as systematic phenomenon across logics\n- Limitations acknowledged: no semantic faithfulness, n=3, coarse β sweep, capacity constraints at 0.5B for joint training, single seeds for SMT-LIB and 8B\n\n**Potential related work gaps to check**:\n- Reward overoptimization literature (Gao et al. 2023)\n- Process reward models (PRM) literature — ISR could be seen as a type of process reward\n- Formal verification quality metrics beyond execution\n- Proof complexity theory\n- Other structural rewards in formal reasoning (beyond the unnamed Prolog work)\n- Ablation-based metrics in other RL domains\n\nOutput your review in a structured format with clear section headers. Be specific — cite sections and specific claims when assessing novelty."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":38953,"cache_read_input_tokens":22934,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":38953},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ed628e99-cc60-4087-9746-1a924b6f6c8d","uuid":"2d24e6c8-d5f0-43bc-94f3-52c1bd14d63d"}
