{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NDNuCUytZYyZmB2JqFhriJ","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 44\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 17:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 方案：FOL+Prover9 单逻辑 50-step GRPO pilot 验证 STA reward 有效性\\\\n  rationale: EMNLP ARR DDL 5/25 仅剩 12 天，需要最快速度验证核心假设。选 FOL+Prover9 因为 hacking 模式最清晰（tautological\\\\n    formulas），STA 的 O(1) 近似最直观（去掉前提后能否证明结论）。50-step pilot 足以观察 ISR 趋势。两个条件并行跑 2 GPU。Pass\\\\n    标准：ISR gap >20pp + accuracy 降幅 <5pp。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 17:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 方案调整：50步→100步 + 趋势判断 + Phase 0 ISR baseline + kill criteria\\\\n  rationale: 采纳 Reviewer 三条 warning：(1) 加 pre-training ISR baseline 锚定训练前水平；(2) 50步太短难以观察\\\\n    reward hacking，改 100步+最后20步 moving average 趋势判断；(3) 补充硬性 kill criteria 防止 DDL\\\\n    压力下无止境调整。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 20:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: Phase 1 r4 fast_isr_fol 训练信号无效，改用 full STA + K=8 重跑\\\\n  rationale: fast_isr_fol 是二值 O(1) 近似（ISR=0 tautology / ISR=1 non-tautology），Qwen3-4B\\\\n    生成的 proved formalization 几乎全部 ISR=1，与 execution-only 零差异。full STA 提供连续 ISR（0.125-0.889\\\\n    in Phase 0），能给出真实梯度信号。K=4 导致 frac_reward_zero_std=0.5-1.0（GRPO 无 advantage），K=8\\\\n    增加 within-group variance。两个改动分别解决 STA 信号粒度和 GRPO 梯度信号两个独立问题。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sta-phase1-exec-only-r4\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: prove_rate 12%→15%, ISR ~0.15, minimal learning\\\\n  - exp_id: sta-phase1-exec-sta-r4\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 与 exec-only 几乎完全相同, fast_isr 提供零额外信号\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 21:59 UTC\\\\n  summary: Reviewer 指出 exec-sta-r5 prove_rate 低于 baseline（退化），STA 50/50 权重过于惩罚性。立即补跑低权重\\\\n    + bonus 模式实验\\\\n  rationale: exec-sta-r5 prove_rate=0.10 < baseline=0.12 < exec-only=0.15。连续 ISR 给\\\\n    proved-but-low-ISR 样本 reward≈0.3（几乎等于未 prove），模型学到 prove 不值得。Kill criteria 未触发（差\\\\n    5pp 非 15pp，权重未调整），但核心假设受挑战。需立即验证：(1) sta_weight=0.1 降低惩罚 (2) ISR-as-bonus 模式 r=exec×(1+α×ISR)\\\\n    避免惩罚。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sta-phase1-exec-sta-r5\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: prove_rate=0.10 < baseline, STA reward 过于惩罚性\\\\n  - exp_id: sta-phase1-exec-only-r5\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: prove_rate=0.15, 复现 r4\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 22:13 UTC\\\\n  summary: ISR/PR 下降因果归因待验证，plan_003 提升为最高优先级消歧实验\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 ISR/PR 64%→33% 有两种解释：(A) STA 检测到 hacking (B) 50/50 权重抑制 prove\\\\n    行为的惩罚效应。ISR 绝对值 ~0.05 ≈ pretrained 水平支持解释 B。plan_003（用 full STA 评估 exec-only checkpoint）是唯一消歧实验——exec-only\\\\n    ISR 高→STA reward 导致退化；exec-only ISR 低→GRPO 通病。paper_framing.md 已将 claim 降级为观察性表述，因果表述需等\\\\n    plan_003 结果。cuda:1 排列改为 plan_003 eval 先行，再 plan_005 training。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sta-phase1-exec-sta-r5\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: ISR/PR 下降但因果不清\\\\n  - exp_id: sta-phase1-exec-only-r5\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: prove_rate=0.12, ISR 未用 full STA 评估\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 22:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: paper_framing.md \\\\\\\"检测 hacking\\\\\\\" claim 降级为观察性表述，plan_003 为消歧实验\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 ISR/PR 64%→33% 下降存在混淆效应：可能是 STA 检测到 hacking，也可能是 50/50 权重抑制\\\\n    prove 行为。ISR 绝对值始终 ~0.05 ≈ pretrained 水平，更像惩罚效应。plan_003（exec-only checkpoint\\\\n    用 full STA 评估）是消歧实验——完成前 paper 不可用因果表述。已修改 paper_framing.md Claim 1 MVP 证据段。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sta-phase1-exec-sta-r5\\\\n    role: evidence_source\\\\n    result: ISR/PR 下降观察到但因果不清\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_003\\\\n    role: disambiguation\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 23:05 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan003 因果消歧：exec-only ISR 提升是有机的，50/50 STA 权重是退化根因，STA 概念本身无问题\\\\n  rationale: plan003 eval 显示 exec-only 100步 checkpoint 的 held-out prove_rate=0.32（baseline\\\\n    0.12 的 2.7x），proved_only_isr=0.642（远高于 exec+STA r5 的 0.043）。ISR 随 prove_rate 同步提升，排除\\\\n    reward hacking。exec+STA 50/50 权重导致 prove_rate 低于 baseline（0.10<0.12），确认权重过高是退化根因。\\\\\\\"STA\\\\n    as reward\\\\\\\" 叙事仍成立，需精确权重调校。注意：当前结果基于 100-step checkpoint，500-step 需重新验证。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan003-eval-exec-only-r5\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: prove_rate=0.32, proved_only_isr=0.642, ISR organic\\\\n  - exp_id: sta-phase1-exec-sta-r5\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: prove_rate=0.10, mean_isr=0.043, degraded\\\\n  - exp_id: sta-phase1-exec-only-r5\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: prove_rate=0.15(last20:0.20), mean_isr=0.148\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 23:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream 审稿确认 5 个结构性弱点，plan_003 消歧确认 penalty effect (B)，论文 story 需重构\\\\n  rationale: Dream best=4/6 Borderline Reject, median=3/6 Weak Reject。两档一致指出：(1) related\\\\n    work 严重不足 6→25+ refs (2) RIP framing 过度——只有 Propagation 可操作化 (3) ISR circularity\\\\n    未解决——需下游验证或 random baseline (4) 8/12 实验 single-seed 不足 (5) ISR sparsity 使 \\\\\\\"dense+automatic\\\\\\\"\\\\n    定位不成立。plan_003 held-out eval 证实 exec-only checkpoint ISR=0.6423（proved-only），高于\\\\n    GT 0.56，确认 ISR/PR 下降是 penalty effect 而非 hacking detection（interpretation B）。论文\\\\n    story 必须从 \\\\\\\"STA detects hacking\\\\\\\" 转向 \\\\\\\"STA as principled structural metric + proper\\\\n    integration via weight tuning\\\\\\\"。新增实验需求：random reward baseline + 3-seed for secondary\\\\n    + downstream validation + curriculum ablation。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan003-eval-exec-only-r5\\\\n    role: disambiguation\\\\n    result: exec-only ISR=0.6423 confirms penalty effect (B)\\\\n  - exp_id: plan005-sta-low-s42\\\\n    role: running\\\\n    result: weight ablation in progress\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260513T215750\\\\n    role: dream\\\\n    result: best 4/6, median 3/6\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: 添加约束 C001（统一训练数据）和 C002（GPU 隔离验证），因连续两个 confound/越界事故\\\\n  rationale: plan001-s43 使用了不同训练数据文件（proofwriter_fol_500.jsonl vs train_500_seed42.jsonl），破坏多\\\\n    seed 对比控制变量。plan013 因 CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES inline 赋值引号问题越界占用两张 GPU，导致 plan001-s43\\\\n    OOM。两个事故均为 Worker 提交流程缺陷，需要硬约束防止复发。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001-exec-only-s43\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: failed (data confound + OOM)\\\\n  - exp_id: plan013-random-reward-s42\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: failed (GPU overflow)\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 02:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: '批准 framing 转向: STA as metric + additive bonus integration，plan002 改用非凸组合公式'\\\\n  rationale: 'plan005 negative 确认 penalty effect: 凸组合 r=α·r_exec+β·r_exec·ISR (α+β=1)\\\\n    下任何 ISR<1 都会惩罚 reward，即使 β=0.1。exec-only (plan003) proved-only ISR=0.6423 远高于\\\\n    plan005 training ISR=0.23。根本原因: 凸组合约束强制 STA 成为 penalty 而非 bonus。plan002 应改用 additive\\\\n    bonus: r=r_exec·(1+β·ISR)，β>0，ISR 只能增加 reward 不能减少。Story 正式从 \\\\\\\"STA detects hacking\\\\\\\"\\\\n    转为 \\\\\\\"STA as principled structural metric + additive bonus integration\\\\\\\"。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan005-sta-low-s42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'negative: convex combination penalty effect confirmed'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan003-eval-exec-only-r5\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'success: exec-only ISR=0.6423 >> STA-trained ISR'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 02:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: '批准 Narrative A+C: STA as diagnostic metric 为主线，bonus-only 公式作为集成尝试，放弃\\\\n    curriculum (B)'\\\\n  rationale: plan005 negative 确认 multiplicative formulation 的 penalty effect 在所有权重下成立。Narrative\\\\n    A 将所有 negative 结果转化为证据（penalty effect 分析 + ISR/PR ratio 作为 structural health indicator），降低\\\\n    DDL 风险。选 C 而非 B：bonus-only 是对 multiplicative penalty 的数学根治（additive, threshold-gated），而\\\\n    curriculum 只是工程 workaround。C 只需改一行 reward 公式 + 1 次训练（~1.5 GPU·h），ROI 最高。如果 C 也\\\\n    negative，论文退化为纯 metric paper 仍可投 EMNLP findings。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan005-sta-low-s42\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: 'negative: weight=0.1 仍 -10.7% prove_rate'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan003-eval-exec-only-r5\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: exec-only ISR=0.6423 proved-only, penalty effect confirmed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 02:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: 新增 additive random 对照实验（plan_017），隔离 ISR structural signal vs GRPO regularization\\\\n    effect\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 指出 GRPO 饱和不对称 confound: exec-only 在 prove_rate=1.0 时 reward\\\\n    variance=0 导致 loss=0（停止学习），而 ISR/random 任何引入 variance 的机制都会维持梯度。plan002 additive\\\\n    ISR 需要匹配的 additive random 对照：r=r_exec·(1+β·random[0,1])。三组比较: (1) ISR>random>exec-only\\\\n    → signal+regularization 都贡献 (2) ISR>random≈exec-only → ISR signal 是关键 (3) ISR≈random>exec-only\\\\n    → 纯 regularization，ISR 内容无价值。这是论文 \\\\\\\"ISR provides unique structural signal\\\\\\\" claim\\\\n    的必要证据。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan013-random-reward-s42-r4\\\\n    role: motivation\\\\n    result: 'confound: convex random introduced variance preventing GRPO saturation'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001-exec-only-s43-r4\\\\n    role: motivation\\\\n    result: 'GRPO saturation confirmed: loss=0 at prove_rate=1.0'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 02:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: ISR 评估方法论标准化：所有 checkpoint 必须用 eval_sta.py (full STA) 统一重评，训练日志 ISR 不可用于论文\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 核实发现：(1) s42-r2 用旧代码 _fast_fn 二值近似，s43-r4 用 _full_fn full STA，跨\\\\n    seed ISR 不可比；(2) plan013 random_reward 仍用 _fast_fn，训练 ISR≈prove_rate 是二值假象；(3)\\\\n    只有 eval_sta.py 产出的 proved_only_ISR 是可靠指标。统一用 eval_sta.py 评估所有 checkpoint 后才能做跨实验比较。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001-exec-only-s43-r4\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: 训练 ISR 与 s42-r2 不可比，需 eval_sta.py 重评\\\\n  - exp_id: plan003-eval-exec-only-r5\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: confirmed full STA, proved_only_ISR=0.6423 有效\\\\n  - exp_id: plan013-random-reward-s42-r4\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: 训练 ISR 不可信(_fast_fn)，需 eval_sta.py 重评\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 02:36 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan013 确认 GRPO 饱和 confound：random reward PR(0.966) > exec-only PR(0.865)，差异源于训练动态而非结构信号\\\\n  rationale: 'plan013 random reward 实验表明：(1) random noise 通过保持 reward variance 防止\\\\n    GRPO 饱和，PR 反超 exec-only；(2) 两者 ISR/PR ratio 均≈1.0，random noise 未提供结构信号；(3) 这直接印证\\\\n    Reviewer #2 的 GRPO 饱和 confound 担忧。结论：exec-only 的 PR→1.0 时 reward_std→0 导致学习停滞，additive\\\\n    bonus (plan002) 才是正确方案——提供 meaningful variance + anti-saturation。plan013 在论文中应正面叙述\\\\n    saturation mechanism，将 additive bonus 的 anti-saturation 作为 key design insight。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan013\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: random reward PR=0.966 > exec-only PR=0.865, ISR/PR≈1.0\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001-s42-r2\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: exec-only PR=0.865, ISR/PR≈1.0\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002\\\\n    role: hypothesis\\\\n    result: running - additive bonus expected to provide meaningful variance + anti-saturation\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 02:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: 训练日志 ISR 跨 seed 不可比，所有 checkpoint 必须用 eval_sta.py 统一评估获取 full STA ISR\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 核实发现：plan001-s42-r2 用 _fast_fn (binary ISR≈prove_rate)，plan001-s43-r4\\\\n    用 _full_fn (连续 ISR)，两者训练日志 ISR 不可比。plan013-r4 同样是 binary approximation。论文正式数据必须来自\\\\n    eval_sta.py 的 full STA 评估。此外 plan001-s43-r4 训练中 ISR 崩塌轨迹（prove_rate=1.0 时 ISR=0.01）是\\\\n    reward hacking 的直接定量证据，强化论文 thesis。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001-exec-only-s42-r2\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: 训练ISR为binary approximation,需eval_sta.py重评\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001-exec-only-s43-r4\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: ISR崩塌轨迹:prove_rate=1.0时ISR=0.01,reward hacking证据\\\\n  - exp_id: plan013-random-reward-s42-r4\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: 训练ISR为binary approximation,需eval_sta.py重评\\\\n  - exp_id: plan003-eval-sta\\\\n    role: validated\\\\n    result: proved_only_ISR=0.6423确认为full STA,可信\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 03:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: eval_sta held-out 评估定量证实 exec-only reward hacking：500步 checkpoint prove_rate=0.93\\\\n    但 ISR=0.1324（median=0.0）\\\\n  rationale: plan001-r2 exec-only checkpoint-500 在 held-out 100题上的 full STA 评估显示 proved_only_ISR=0.1324，中位\\\\n    ISR=0.0——模型高 prove_rate 完全依赖 solver 宽松性而非正确 FOL 结构。对比 plan003（100步 checkpoint）的\\\\n    ISR=0.6423，ISR 随训练从 64% 崩塌到 13%，是 reward hacking 的直接定量证据。跨 seed 一致性已验证（s42 last100\\\\n    PR=0.865 vs s43 last100 PR=0.883）。这构成论文 Core Claim 1 的核心证据。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001-exec-only-s42-r2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: held-out PR=0.93, proved_only_ISR=0.1324, median_ISR=0.0\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001-exec-only-s43-r4\\\\n    role: replication\\\\n    result: 训练ISR=0.087(if _full_fn), last100_PR=0.883, 跨seed一致\\\\n  - exp_id: plan003-eval-exec-only-r5\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: 100步checkpoint ISR=0.6423, 训练前结构质量高\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 03:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: random reward held-out ISR=0.535 >> exec-only ISR=0.132，anti-saturation\\\\n    效应可能足以改善结构质量，ISR-specific signal 待 plan002 vs plan017 验证\\\\n  rationale: plan013 random reward 在 held-out 上 prove_rate=1.0, ISR=0.535, 大幅优于 exec-only\\\\n    (PR=0.93, ISR=0.132)。Random noise 通过防止 GRPO reward variance→0 的饱和效应让模型持续学习。这挑战了\\\\\\\"ISR\\\\n    提供结构信号\\\\\\\"的叙事——可能仅 anti-saturation 就够。关键验证：plan002 (additive ISR) vs plan017 (additive\\\\n    random) 的 matched control，加上 formalization 组件数对比排除长度 confound。论文叙事可能需要从\\\\\\\"ISR reward\\\\\\\"转向\\\\\\\"GRPO\\\\n    饱和机制 + STA 诊断工具\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan013-random-reward-s42-r4\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: held-out PR=1.0, ISR=0.535, median_ISR=0.5, min_ISR=0.5\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001-exec-only-s42-r2\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: held-out PR=0.93, ISR=0.132, median_ISR=0.0\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b03-s42\\\\n    role: pending\\\\n    result: 中期PR严重偏低(39.8%步PR=0),待完成\\\\n  - exp_id: plan017-additive-random-s42\\\\n    role: pending\\\\n    result: 刚启动,matched control\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 03:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: 推翻 D017：plan013 held-out ISR=0.535 是 tautological hacking 假象（100% P→P），random\\\\n    reward 加速 hacking 而非改善结构\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 逐样本检查 plan013 eval_sta 结果：100/100 样本全部是「把 conclusion 抄一遍当 premise」(P→P\\\\n    tautology)，ISR=0.5 是机械值（2 components, 1 necessary）而非真实结构质量。D017 基于 ISR=0.535 得出的\\\\\\\"anti-saturation\\\\n    改善结构\\\\\\\"结论完全错误。实际情况：random reward 让模型找到了最终极的 hacking 捷径——100% tautological formalization。对比\\\\n    exec-only 100步 ISR=0.6423（有真实推理）→ 500步 ISR=0.132（退化但非全 tautological），random reward\\\\n    加速了 hacking 收敛。plan002 eval_sta 结果成为关键：如果 additive ISR bonus 产生的是非 tautological\\\\n    formalization，即使 PR 低也是积极信号——ISR reward 在抵抗 hacking。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan013-random-reward-s42-r4\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 100% tautological P→P, ISR=0.5 是机械值而非结构质量\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001-exec-only-s42-r2\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: held-out PR=0.93, ISR=0.132, 部分真实推理\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b03-s42\\\\n    role: pending_critical\\\\n    result: PR低但可能是真实推理, eval_sta 待出\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 03:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: ISR 衡量 syntactic component necessity 而非 semantic faithfulness，论文需明确边界并用\\\\n    plan014 downstream validation 补盲区\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 ISR 反直觉行为：plan013 P→P 纯重言式 ISR=0.5 > plan001 多前提嵌入 conclusion\\\\n    ISR≈0。从语义忠实度看 P→P 更差（完全忽略 context），但 ISR 定义下反而更高，因为 ISR=n_necessary/n_components，极简\\\\n    formalization 的分母小。论文不能将 ISR 差异直接等同于 formalization 质量差异——需明确 ISR 的 scope 是 component\\\\n    necessity。plan014 downstream NLI validation 直接测量 semantic faithfulness，弥补 ISR\\\\n    盲区。同时建议考虑组合指标（ISR + non-tautological check + 最小组件数阈值）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan013-random-reward-s42-r4\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: P→P tautology ISR=0.5, 语义完全退化但ISR不低\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001-exec-only-s42-r2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 多前提嵌入conclusion ISR≈0, 语义更好但ISR更低\\\\n  - exp_id: plan014\\\\n    role: mitigation\\\\n    result: downstream NLI validation 补充语义忠实度测量\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 03:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan002 additive ISR β=0.3 负面结果确认：PR=18% + ISR=0.1427，ISR reward 作为训练信号的路线全面失败，论文转向纯诊断/分析贡献\\\\n  rationale: 'plan002 held-out eval: PR=18%（最差）, ISR=0.1427≈exec-only 0.1324。加上 plan005\\\\n    (convex, negative) 和 plan013 (random, tautological hacking)，所有 ISR-as-reward 方案均失败。但三个条件产生了三种不同的退化模式（conclusion\\\\n    embedding / P→P tautology / repetitive cycling），这本身是有价值的研究发现。论文应完全放弃\\\\\\\"ISR reward\\\\n    改善训练\\\\\\\"的 claim，转向：(1) STA/ISR 作为诊断工具检测 reward hacking (2) GRPO saturation 机制分析 (3)\\\\n    不同 reward 信号下的 hacking 策略分类学 (4) ISR 随训练的崩塌轨迹。plan014 downstream validation 成为证明\\\\n    ISR 诊断价值的关键实验。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b03-s42\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'negative: PR=18%, ISR=0.1427, 重复前提循环退化'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan005-sta-low-s42\\\\n    role: prior_negative\\\\n    result: convex combination penalty effect\\\\n  - exp_id: plan013-random-reward-s42-r4\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: 100% tautological hacking, ISR=0.5 假象\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001-exec-only-s42-r2\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: PR=93%, ISR=0.132, conclusion embedding\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D019\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:28 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan014 ISR-accuracy 假说被否定；ISR 定位为 syntactic necessity 指标，不 claim semantic\\\\n    quality proxy\\\\n  rationale: Spearman ρ(ISR, entailment_accuracy) = -0.049, p=0.187（n=732），ISR-based\\\\n    BoN Δ=0.88pp CI含零。同时发现系统性 true 偏差（gold=true 91.2% acc, gold=false 0%），说明 formalization\\\\n    pipeline 本身有 truth bias。ISR 衡量组件必要性（去掉后证明是否成立），不衡量 formalization 是否语义忠实。论文应明确此\\\\n    limitation，将 plan014 作为 negative result 诚实报告，刻画 ISR 能力边界。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan014-downstream-nli-s42\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: negative — ISR与下游NLI准确率无显著相关\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:30 UTC\\\\n  summary: 选备选 A：ISR downstream 验证降级为 limitation/future work，不追加 NLI 替代实验\\\\n  rationale: ISR 结构价值已有 component count 差异（p<0.0001）和 cross-checkpoint 对比强证据。NLI negative\\\\n    源于 formalization model 的 true-bias（非 ISR 本身缺陷），换 downstream 任务（B）在同一 model 上大概率复现同样问题。n=12\\\\n    的 bucket 趋势（C）统计不可靠。聚焦 plan017 + s44 完成核心证据链。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan014-downstream-nli-s42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 05:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: paper_framing.md 全量重写：4 条诊断/分析 claims 替代旧 2 条 reward methodology claims，与\\\\n    D020 pivot 一致\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer CRITICAL: paper_framing.md 仍写 \\\\\\\"STA as Reward Design Methodology\\\\\\\"\\\\n    + additive bonus headline，但 D020 已确认 ISR-as-reward 全面失败。新 framing 4 条 claims:\\\\n    (1) ISR as hacking diagnostic (ISR 崩塌轨迹), (2) GRPO saturation mechanism, (3) hacking\\\\n    taxonomy (4 种模式), (4) ISR capability boundary (syntactic necessity ≠ semantic\\\\n    faithfulness)。Story spine 从 \\\\\\\"propose structural reward\\\\\\\" 转为 \\\\\\\"diagnostic tool +\\\\n    systematic empirical study of reward hacking\\\\\\\"。负面结果表（convex/additive/random）作